path
You walk down a well trodden path

road
You walk down a concrete road.

train cabin
Something large towers over you.
Upon further examination, you see that it is a section of a train.

train cabin_enter
You enter through a squaking doorway.
The place is rusty, the seats are torn to shreds.

train cabin_examine
You're able to ignore the smell of rot, but not the sight of the many corpses.
A train collision must have killed them, the others... likely found a worse fate.

nothing_examine_train cabin
There is nothing in here.

nothing_train cabin

hat_train cabin
To the right of the doorway are hooks.

hat_examine_train cabin
One of the hooks holds a hat.
A cowboy hat! You haven't seen one in ages.

suitcase_train cabin
Baggage lies on the floor.

suitcase_examine_train cabin
A bright green, small suitcase catches your attention.
Inside is a toy compass, a school uniform, and some notebooks.
You'd like to imagine the child's death was quick and painless.

ant
An ant tries to attack you

ant_attack
It bites you

ant_special
The ant crawls towards you

ant_data0
A simple ant.
It can move towards you or bite.

ant_data1
An ant. Lives in fields and forests commonly.
It can move towards you or bite.
No [special] attack.

ant_data2
An ant. Lives in fields and forests commonly. Can be spotted in junkyards.
It can move towards you or bite.
No [special] attack.
The little critter is a soldier, and has seen many battles
He's one of the few that survived between the war between the ant colony and bug colony.

ant_kill
Just as the gods above were mortal,
you too were not immune to a determined creature.

ant_death
You stomp on the ant with one foot and it dies.

ant_dead
A dead, slightly twitching black spot is on the floor.

ant_path
Something pokes from under your shoe.
An ant initiates battle with you!

ant_road
You stop in your tracks to look at a block dot on the road in front of you.
The ant seems angry.

slime
A dark blob rolls forward

slime_attack
The blob morphs very sharp teeth and bites you

slime_special
The blob recombines, gaining some health.

slime_data0
Slimy black blob.
It can morph or heal.

slime_data1
Slimy, semi-translucent black blob. It seems to have two small eyes inside it.
It almost looks determined to defeat you, the way it rolls towards you.
It can morph [attack] or heal [special].

slime_data2
Slimy, semi-translucent black blob. It seems to have two small eyes inside it.
It's determination kind of reminds you... of yourself.
It can morph [attack] or heal [special].

slime_kill
Your strength slowly fades.
You grow tired.
A dark, soft cushion forms below you, welcoming you just as hell welcomes its demons.

slime_death
You chop the thing up into tiny pieces. It won't recombine for a long while now.

slime_path
Suddenly, a black blob rolls out of the bushes and onto the road.
It blocks your way.

slime_road
A black blob blocks the way in front of you.

slime_building
A blob starts rolling down the broken stairs, and you soon recognize it: A slime.
It's sliding towards you at unexpected speeds.

slime_dead
A puddle of black ooze is on the ground. It's too weak to face you again.

cat
Something rustles above you.
Suddenly, a large four-legged beast hops down from a tree a couple feet in front of you.

cat_attack
The beast swipes at you with its claws

cat_special
The beast lunges forward, its teeth aimed at your neck.
You dodge, but not before it deals some damage.

cat_data0
Some kind of big beast.
It can attack with claws or by biting.

cat_data1
The beast is on all fours, and even then it is almost your height.
Its dark brown fur blends with the trees around, and its tail sways angrily behind it.
It can attack with claws or [special] bite for twice the damage.

cat_data2
The beast is on all fours, and even then it is almost your height.
Its dark brown fur blends with the trees around, and its tail sways angrily behind it.
Lives in fir forests, and can be found in junkyards.
It can attack with claws or [special] bite for twice the damage.

cat_kill
The barrage of attacks doesn't end.
Your eyes flutter shut.
The wounds all over your body are too much for you to handle.

cat_death
As the beast prepares to lunge, you deal one last blow.
It stops mid-track, and collapses. Dead.

cat_dead
A dead beast. Its wounds ooze a mixture of blood and black goo.

cat_path
A growl gives you just enough time to move out of the way,
as a beast jumps onto the path. Get ready.

cat_road
Large paws thump against the road, getting louder.
A beast is running towards you. Get ready.

cat_room
A low growl suddenly distracts you. Two golden eyes stare at you from under the table.

you
You stand in front of yourself.

you_attack
You attack yourself

you_special
You copy your action

you_kill
You die, and yet you continues on.

you_death
You kill yourself. And yet you survive.


shotgun
You found a fully loaded shotgun.

shotgun_use
BAM!
The thing in front of you now has a giant hole.

shotgun_examine1
A shotgun, like your mother used to own. Back when the world was normal.
When your biggest worries were getting to work on time and looking presentable

shotgun_examine2
The side of the handle has a small engraving: "A+E"

shotgun_examine3
Another shotgun.
In the world you live in, who doesn't want more?

shotgun_store
The gun sits heavy in your bag.
2 shotgun uses added to inventory

medkit
A mini-medkit lies on the floor.

medkit_examine1
The small medkit has all you would need:
bandages, gauzes, wipes, antibiotics, scissors... and so on

medkit_examine2
This one was found already opened.
The body nearby it tells you it was too late for them.

medkit_examine3
The medkit is tattered, and the red cross barely visible.
You vaguely remember learning about the symbol in school.

medkit_train cabin
There's a medkit under one of the chairs.

wall
A concrete piece of wall stands in front of you.
The cracks in it make it easy to get through.

leaning wall
A concrete piece of wall. It seems very shaky.

leaning wall_fell
Sure enough, the wall falls,
and as you dodge some rocks hit you.

barbed wire
You find some hastily placed wooden fences, covered in barbed wire.

train couple
You see a link between trains in front of you.
It's easy to just jump over it.

mech
A war mech. Was this what they used against the monsters?


'you'
It's 'you'. 'You' mirror your movements.

engine coil
Some broken pieces of an engine. It won't be of any use.

pistol
A bloody pistol lies on the floor.

pistol_room
Looking inside some cabinets, you find a pistol in one.
It is loaded.

pistol_building
A desk is at one corner of the building. In its cabinet is a pistol.
Useful.

pine tree
A pine tree covers your walk in shade.

ship cog
A gigantic, wheel, or mechanical cog?
It must have been for one of the old spaceship models.

A gigantic metal beam with three ridges in it.
You recognize it as a part of the old spaceship engines.

water
You wade into lake water

tree
A tree- one you don't recognize- stands to the side of the path.
It brings some welcome shade.

room
A destroyed building has left just four walls standing. Just one room.

room_enter
You open the door to enter. It falls down when you touch it.

room_examine
It's a quaint little room. Homely, too.
Some ripped curtains are over the window,
and a wooden table in the middle reminds you of your own home. Your own family.

picture frame_room
There's a picture frame on a shelf, above the fireplace.

picture frame_examine_room
The photo is ripped in half. But you can see a young woman in the photo.
She is smiling. How long was it since you smiled?

food_room
On the table is a pot of soup, as if the family had left mid-dinner.

food_examine_room
The soup is stale, old.
Some flies have gathered around, trying to get inside through the gap between the lid and pot.

building
You see a relatively stable building.

building_enter
The door swings open, and you enter.
Its stone floor rings out from under your shoes.

build_examine
The floor is white, the walls grey.
Nearly everything is made of either concrete or metal.

nothing_building

nothing_examine_building
There is nothing useful here anymore.



phone_building
You step on something. Ah, a phone. It hasn't broken, fortunately.

phone_examine_building
You flip it open. Some of the strange contacts catch your attention:
The Coolest, Toffee, Bohnen, Doodle
But calling doesn't work, and neither does texting.

papers_building
A layer of newspapers covers the floor of the room.

papers_examine_building
Hm, they're all the same. The cover says:
Astronaut passes out during speech! Is this space sickness or something more?

grave
You nearly trip over some recently dug soil.
The cross near it tells you it's a grave.

knife
A pocket knife lies on the ground.

knife_train cabin
The window is cracked, and as you take steps, glass cracks under your shoes.
A knife lies right below the window.

bug
In front of you is a strange, large bug.
When it sees you, It rises up, hissing.

bug_attack
The bug viciously bites you.
Your arm hurts strangely. The bite must've been venomous.

bug_special
The bug lunges at you. You shield yourself with your bag, but that captures its attention.

bug_data0
Its antenna and exoskeleton tells you its an insect.
It can attack you with its mandibles, or use them to steal your items.

bug_data1
The strange creature has antenna, an elongated thorax, and white spots.
Its antenna drips black goo.
It can attack with mandibles or [special] yoink your stuff.

bug_data2
The strange creature has antenna, an elongated thorax, and white spots.
Its antenna drips black goo, like most other creatures you've seen.
Lives in all forests, and you remember finding some bug corpses full of ants.

bug_train cabin
Something to your left starts making cracking sounds.
Suddenly, a large worm-like thing starts sliding towards you.

bug_dead
A dead bug-like creature.

bug_death
You attack the creature on its back, between its head and thorax.
It screeches, before finally curling up, dead.

bug_path
A gigantic, bug-like creature jumps onto the path in front of you.
It doesn't look friendly.

bug_road
A scittering of limbs warns you as a gigantic bug creature rush towards you.
It does't look too happy.

lily flower
A small, white flower is sprouting from the ground. It has a strange blue stem.

lily flower_examine
You recognize this as a lily flower.
Although, the blue stem is a relatively new thing for the species.

lily flower_room
On the table is a small vase, with one flower in it.

lily flower_examine_room
The flower is a lily flower, its blue stem staining the water the same shade.

lily flower_building
The building you're in has a front desk. On it there is one lone flower.
A lily flower.

lion's tongue flower
In between some rocks, you find a small but stubborn sprout, fully yellow.

lion's tongue flower_examine
It's a lion's tongue flower. These were always a symbol of strength, of determination.
And soon, a symbol of hope. That humans will survive.

bluebell flower
In a pile of dark ooze, a bluebell flower has sprouted.
Its strange bell-shape-making petals have captured your attention.

bluebell flower_examine
The bluebell flower has been used as an ingredient for stimulants.
In medical and in sports use. It gives you some ideas.

Johnny
A man leans against the pole. The hood of his jacket hides his face.

Johnny_start
"Haven't seen anyone else in a while now. How'd you survive the crash?"

Johnny_a
He tilts his head, then shrugs.
"Hm. Are you... mute?"

Johnny_y
He

Johnny_n
He nods. "Alright. Guess you just don't want to talk"

Alicia
You find a young woman rocking back and forth.

Alicia_start
She looks up at you. She has a bizarre look in her eyes.
"You can't die, you can't die, you can't die, you won't die, you won't die..."

Alicia_a
She notices that you can't answer, and starts laughing.
"Can't mimic a voice, can you? You monster!"

Alicia_y
"Go! Go away! Do you know what happened because of you?"

Alicia_y_y
"Then have you no shame to stay here?"

Alicia_y_y_y
She shakes her head, then starts rocking again.

Alicia_y_y_n
She shakes her head roughly, then starts rocking again.

Alicia_y_n
She points at you, shakily getting up.
"Because of you!!! YOU! They all died! They all died when you came here! Why-"
She shakes her head violently, as if to get rid of her grief.
"Will you just leave us alone?"

Alicia_y_n_y
She sighs, sitting back down, exhausted.
"Then go"

Alicia_y_n_n
She lunges at you, but you step away.
"Monster, monster, monster, monster, monster..."

Dominique
There's a kid sitting on the floor.

Dominique_start
"Do you think they will leave soon?" He asks quietly.

Dominique_a
He doesn't react to your answer.
"Mom didn't survive when the explosion happened. She hid me in the basement."
"Have you seen what happens to those who couldn't hide?"

Dominique_n
"They- they got weird. Their faces are all mangled, and they wheeze, like this:"
He mimics the sound, then starts coughing. "Sorry, do you have food?"

Dominique_n_y
You hand him a slice of bread you had in your pocket. It's not too old, fortunately.
"Thank you," He says between bites, "Well, anyways the explosion was really really big. It was scary.
But mom was more scary. She tried to hurt me, so I ran till I got here. It's safe here. Will you stay?"

Dominique_n_y_y
""

Dominique_n_y_n
"Why not? Are you searching for something?"

Dominique_n_y_n_y
"Probably the cure. Everyone's looking for something to stop it.
I bet there's nothing." He looks away. "Things never get better."

Dominique_n_y_n_n
"Then, someone?"

Dominique_n_y_n_n_y
"Yeah, a lot of people lost someone." He pauses. "Don't take this the wrong way,
but I think you should stop. It's easier to remain hopeful than to know the truth."

Dominique_n_y_n_n_n
He chuckles. "Then why would you even go out? Just stay at this point."
He shakes his head at you. "Crazy..." he mutters, then lies down.

Dominique_y
"When I got out, she wasn't mom anymore. She- she tried to attack me!
I ran far, till I got to this city." He flinches, and hugs his stomach. "Er, do you have any food maybe?"

Dominique_y_n
You shake your head. He looks disappointed.
"Do you know where to get something, at least?"

Dominique_y_n_y
You nod you head, and point to some people nearby.
"They won't share with me. They're bad people. Crazies."
You stare at him blankly.
"Do you know what they are?"

Dominique_y_n_n
You shake your head sadly. His shoulders slump.
"Then go away." He lies down and closes his eyes.

Dominique_y_n_y_y
"Good. Then don't come near them."
He doubles over again, clearly in pain. He's too exhausted to speak anymore.

Dominique_y_n_y_n
"They think the monsters are good. I mean, maybe at first, yeah, but-urgh-"
He doubles over again, cleanly in pain. He's too exhausted to continue.

Dominique_y_y
You hand him a slice of bread you had in your pocket. It's not too old, fortunately.
"Thanks! How'd you get here? Did you kill lots of monsters?"


Dominique_y_y_y
You nod your head. His eyes open in wonder.
"Mom told me it was from the astronauts. Before she died, I mean.
That the monsters came from the sickness. Did you see black goo on them?"

Dominique_y_y_n
You shake your head.
"Same here. I haven't left the city since mom died.
...but did you see at least see monsters on the way here?"


Dominique_y_y_n_y
Your nod satisfies him.
"I saw them too. They...looked like mom."
He pauses. "What if they weren't always bad. Do you think they were always angry?"

Dominique_y_y_n_n
When you shake your head, he looks at you confused. Then his expression turns dark.
"What? You don't see them as monsters? You're stupid like those crazies.
Those things are bad now. The sickness made them evil like it did to-"
He stops. He turns his head to the side, too upset to continue.

Dominique_y_y_n_y_n
He finishes the bread, and hugs himself tightly. You pass to him a jacket.
"I hate it. I hate how angry they looked. I wish it all stopped. I wish mom was-"
He stops, and rests his head on his knees. His expression reminds you of someone.

Dominique_y_y_n_y_y
He finishes the bread, and hugs himself tightly. You pass to him a jacket.
"I guess I'm thinking too much about it."
He looks out to the distance, deep in thought.

Dominique_y_y_y_y
You nod your head again.
"I wish they didn't go to space. I wanna see my friends again, and mom. I want a normal life.
Though, everyone does I guess. You too, right?"

Dominique_y_y_y_n
He shrugs. "Must've been something else then."

Dominique_y_y_y_y_y
He smiles at your agreement, then lies down.
"Thanks for the bread."

Dominique_y_y_y_y_n
He looks at you confused, then lies down, turning to his side.
"Well, anyways thanks for the bread."


Ella
An older lady stands near a wall, shuffling cards.

Ella_a
She looks up at you when you come closer.
"How you doin' on this day?"

Ella_start
Realizing you can't speak, she stops shuffling.
"Least you don't need a tongue to play poker.
Care for a game?"

Ella_y

Ella_n
You shake your head.
"Alrighty then," she says, then resumes shuffling.
The silence is filled with the flipping, before she asks:
"Any chance you seen a certain lady out there? Her name's Alicia Thunder."

Ella_n_y
You remember the name from somewhere. You nod to the woman.
She brightens up.
"Really? Where was- oh, you can't answer"
She pauses to think, then ruffles through a bag on the floor,
finding a broken half of a pencil and a newspaper.
"Write down where you saw her, will ya? She's very dear to me."

Ella_n_y_y
The memory is fuzzy, but you're able to write down the name of the city.
The lady seems to recognize the name, as she starts quickly packing up the bag.
"Thanks, mister!" She hugs you unexpectedly, before running off in the direction of the city.